# Credentials never enter the repository
kaggle.json

# Image payloads and archives are distributed outside git.
# ~98,000 JPEGs across detection/ and ocr/ total roughly 1.8 GiB. Git LFS is a
# poor fit: every object costs its own HTTPS round-trip, so a push of this many
# small files stalls, and the volume exceeds the free LFS storage allowance.
# Everything needed to regenerate them deterministically (seed 20260814) is
# committed: source code, configuration, labels, and the full manifests.
raw/
detection/images/
ocr/images/
reports/contact_sheets/
*.zip
*.rar

# Training outputs
ocr_training/checkpoints/
